   "channel_name": "Groww",
   "description": "Which companies are showing stronger growth than their own recent trend?\n\nIn this video, we analyse five companies where Q2 FY27 sales and profit growth came in above their previous four-quarter averages, while margins also improved.\n\nWe look at what is actually driving the growth, order books, capacity expansion, certification volumes, domestic pharma demand, hotel occupancy and room rates.\n\nBut strong quarterly numbers alone are not enough. Valuation, execution risk, working capital, segment-level weakness and the sustainability of growth all matter.\n\nThe key question is whether this quarter marks the start of a stronger earnings cycle, or just a temporary spike in performance.\n\nThis video is for educational purposes only and is not a buy or sell recommendation.\n\nTimestamps:\n0:00 Intro\n0:44 Company 1\n3:31 Company 2\n6:09 Company 3\n8:48 Company 4\n11:46 Company 5\n\nAbout Groww: \nGroww is India\u2019s Best Investment App and the Largest Stock Broker.\n\nFind us here:\nAndroid app: https://app.groww.in/v3cO/f9o4prne\niOS app: https://app.groww.in/v3cO/tu0yrc3e\nWebsite: https://groww.in/\n\nFollow us here on other channels:\n\n\ud83d\udd14 Mutual Funds at Groww: https://www.youtube.com/@MutualFundsWithGroww\n\ud83d\udd14 Trading with Groww: https://youtube.com/c/TradingwithGroww\n\ud83d\udd14 Groww Kannada: https://www.youtube.com/@GrowwKannada\n\ud83d\udd14 Groww Tamil: https://www.youtube.com/@GrowwTamil\n\ud83d\udd14 Groww Telugu: https://www.youtube.com/@GrowwTelugu\n\ud83d\udd14 Groww Malayalam: https://www.youtube.com/@GrowwMalayalam\n\ud83d\udd14 Get to Know Groww: https://www.youtube.com/@Gettoknowgroww\n\ud83d\udd14 Ipo review by Groww: https://www.youtube.com/@iporeviewbygroww\n\ud83d\udd14 Money Talks by Groww: https://youtube.com/@moneytalksbygroww\n\ud83d\udd14 Thrive by Groww: https://youtube.com/@thrivebygroww\n\ud83d\udd14 How they made it by Groww: https://youtube.com/@Howtheymadeitbygroww\n\nFollow us on:\nFacebo